 "spreads": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "title": "The Dry Land",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "1.1",
     "text": "Once, there was no rain. No rain for a long, long time.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Once, there was no rain. No rain for a long, long time."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "1.2",
     "text": "The river was low. The fields were brown and dry.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "The river was low. The fields were brown and dry."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "1.3",
     "text": "Old Buffalo walked slowly to the pond. \"I am so thirsty,\" he said.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Old Buffalo walked slowly to the pond."
      ],
      [
       "buffalo",
       "I am so thirsty,"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "he said."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "1.4",
     "text": "But the pond was only mud. In the mud sat a little toad. His name was Kankak.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "But the pond was only mud. In the mud sat a little toad. His name was Kan-kahk."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "1.5",
     "text": "Kankak looked up at the empty sky. \"Where is the rain?\" he asked.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Kan-kahk looked up at the empty sky."
      ],
      [
       "kankak",
       "Where is the rain?"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "he asked."
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "title": "Too Small?",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "2.1",
     "text": "\"The rain lives up in the sky, with the Sky King,\" said Old Buffalo.",
     "say": [
      [
       "buffalo",
       "The rain lives up in the sky, with the Sky King,"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said Old Buffalo."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "2.2",
     "text": "\"Then let's go up and ask him!\" said Kankak.",
     "say": [
      [
       "kankak",
       "Then let's go up and ask him!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said Kan-kahk."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "2.3",
     "text": "The animals laughed. \"You? You are too small!\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "The animals laughed."
      ],
      [
       "dog",
       "You?"
      ],
      [
       "cat",
       "You are too small!"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "2.4",
     "text": "Kankak stood up tall, as tall as a little toad can. \"Small feet can walk a long way,\" he said.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Kan-kahk stood up tall, as tall as a little toad can."
      ],
      [
       "kankak",
       "Small feet can walk a long way,"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "he said."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "2.5",
     "text": "And off he went: hop, hop, hop, toward the hills.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "And off he went: hop, hop, hop, toward the hills."
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "title": "Friends Join In",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "3.1",
     "text": "On the way, Kankak met Tik the termite. \"Where are you going?\" asked Tik.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "On the way, Kan-kahk met Tik the termite."
      ],
      [
       "tik",
       "Where are you going?"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "asked Tik."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "3.2",
     "text": "\"Up to the sky, to ask for rain!\" said Kankak. \"I will come too!\" said Tik.",
     "say": [
      [
       "kankak",
       "Up to the sky, to ask for rain!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said Kan-kahk."
      ],
      [
       "tik",
       "I will come too!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said Tik."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "3.3",
     "text": "Then came Bizzy the bee. Buzz, buzz! \"Me too!\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Then came Bizzy the bee."
      ],
      [
       "bizzy",
       "Buzz, buzz! Me too!"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "3.4",
     "text": "Then came Pinch the scorpion. Snip, snip! \"Me too!\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Then came Pinch the scorpion."
      ],
      [
       "pinch",
       "Snip, snip! Me too!"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "3.5",
     "text": "Then came the frogs, hop, hop, hop. \"Ribbit! Us too!\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Then came the frogs, hop, hop, hop."
      ],
      [
       "frogs",
       "Ribbit! Us too!"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "3.6",
     "text": "Now Kankak had an army. A very small army!",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Now Kan-kahk had an army. A very small army!"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "title": "The Road to the Sky",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "4.1",
     "text": "They came to the end of the land. The sky was far, far above. \"How can we get up there?\" asked Bizzy.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "They came to the end of the land. The sky was far, far above."
      ],
      [
       "bizzy",
       "How can we get up there?"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "asked Bizzy."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "4.2",
     "text": "\"Leave it to us!\" said Tik. A thousand termites came out of the ground.",
     "say": [
      [
       "tik",
       "Leave it to us!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said Tik. A thousand termites came out of the ground."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "4.3",
     "text": "They built a road of mud, up and up, round and round, all the way to the clouds.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "They built a road of mud, up and up, round and round, all the way to the clouds."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "4.4",
     "text": "Up, up, up went the little army. It was windy and cold, and the frogs held on tight.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Up, up, up went the little army. It was windy and cold, and the frogs held on tight."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "4.5",
     "text": "At the top, on a big white cloud, was the Sky King's house.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "At the top, on a big white cloud, was the Sky King's house."
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "title": "The Sky King",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "5.1",
     "text": "The Sky King sat on his cloud chair. He had a long white beard, and he looked very cross.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "The Sky King sat on his cloud chair. He had a long white beard, and he looked very cross."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "5.2",
     "text": "Behind him, all the rain clouds were tied up with a big rope.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Behind him, all the rain clouds were tied up with a big rope."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "5.3",
     "text": "\"Please, Sky King,\" said Kankak. \"The land is so dry. Can we have some rain?\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "kankak",
       "Please, Sky King,"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said Kan-kahk."
      ],
      [
       "kankak",
       "The land is so dry. Can we have some rain?"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "5.4",
     "text": "\"No!\" said the Sky King. He folded his arms. \"No, no, NO!\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "skyking",
       "No!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said the Sky King. He folded his arms."
      ],
      [
       "skyking",
       "No, no, NO!"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "5.5",
     "text": "\"Then we will make you!\" said Pinch.",
     "say": [
      [
       "pinch",
       "Then we will make you!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said Pinch."
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "title": "Buzz, Nibble, Pinch!",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "6.1",
     "text": "Bizzy buzzed round and round the Sky King's nose. Buzz, buzz, buzz!",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Bizzy buzzed round and round the Sky King's nose. Buzz, buzz, buzz!"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "6.2",
     "text": "\"Ah... ah... ACHOO!\" A big puff of cloud came out. But no rain.",
     "say": [
      [
       "skyking",
       "Ah... ah... ACHOO!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "A big puff of cloud came out. But no rain."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "6.3",
     "text": "Tik and the termites nibbled his chair. Nibble, nibble! The chair wobbled. But no rain.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Tik and the termites nibbled his chair. Nibble, nibble! The chair wobbled. But no rain."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "6.4",
     "text": "Pinch pinched the Sky King's big toe. Snip! \"Ow!\" But still, no rain.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Pinch pinched the Sky King's big toe. Snip!"
      ],
      [
       "skyking",
       "Ow!"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "But still, no rain."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "6.5",
     "text": "\"Buzz, nibble, pinch, all you like,\" said the Sky King. \"I will NOT send the rain!\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "skyking",
       "Buzz, nibble, pinch, all you like,"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "said the Sky King."
      ],
      [
       "skyking",
       "I will NOT send the rain!"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "title": "Why So Cross?",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "7.1",
     "text": "Kankak hopped close to the Sky King. He did not buzz. He did not pinch.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "Kan-kahk hopped close to the Sky King. He did not buzz. He did not pinch."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "7.2",
     "text": "\"Sky King,\" he said softly, \"why are you so cross?\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "kankak",
       "Sky King,"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "he said softly,"
      ],
      [
       "kankak",
       "why are you so cross?"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "7.3",
     "text": "The Sky King looked down at the little toad. His big eyes were sad.",
     "say": [
      [
       "narrator",
       "The Sky King looked down at the little toad. His big eyes were sad."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "7.4",
     "text": "\"Every year I send the rain,\" he said. \"The plants grow. The rivers fill. But nobody ever says thank you.\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "skyking",
       "Every year I send the rain,"
      ],
      [
       "narrator",
       "he said."
      ],
      [
       "skyking",
       "The plants grow. The rivers fill. But nobody ever says thank you."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "7.5",
     "text": "\"Nobody?\" asked Kankak. \"Nobody,\" said the Sky King. \"So, no more rain.\"",
     "say": [
      [
       "kankak",
       "Nobody?"
      ],
      [
