       "narrator",
       "he said."
      ],
      [
       "kankak",
       "Let's say it now!"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "8.2",
     "text": "The frogs sang, \"Ribbit, thank you!\" Bizzy hummed, \"Thank you!\"",
     "say": [
